stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Queued: publish
  Queued --> InProgress: worker begins
  InProgress --> Pending: load ok
  InProgress --> Queued: transient failure (retry)
  InProgress --> Deferred: firm cap or breaker open
  Deferred --> Queued: redelivered
  InProgress --> Failed: fatal or retries exhausted
  Failed --> [*]
  Pending --> Applied: apply
  Pending --> Declined: decline
  Pending --> Withdrawn: offer withdrawn
  Applied --> [*]
  Declined --> [*]
  Withdrawn --> [*]
